   "id": "file:packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/fetch.ts",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "fetch.ts",
   "filePath": "packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/fetch.ts",
   "summary": "DeepSeek Fetch API provider：一次直接请求取页面 Markdown、无辅助模型调用；API 不报目标状态码与最终 URL，成功即按 HTTP 200 语义返回请求页；八语种 picker description 声明服务端抓取/计费/不可达内网的属性。",
   "tags": [
    "web-fetch-provider",
    "markdown-fetch",
    "provider"
   ],
   "complexity": "moderate"
  },
  {
   "id": "class:packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/fetch.ts:DeepSeekFetchApiProvider",
   "type": "class",
   "name": "DeepSeekFetchApiProvider",
   "filePath": "packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/fetch.ts",
   "lineRange": [
    30,
    65
   ],
   "summary": "implements WebFetchProvider（id deepseek-fetch-api）：available 检查凭据存在+URL 可解析；fetch 经 dispatchDeepSeekWeb POST /fetch（body 只带 url），decode 校验 content 字符串后折成 text 结果。",
   "tags": [
    "web-fetch-provider",
    "provider-role",
    "web-seam"
   ],
   "complexity": "moderate"
  },
  {
   "id": "file:packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/index.ts",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "index.ts",
   "filePath": "packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/index.ts",
   "summary": "插件入口（name web-deepseek-api，inject ['web']）：把 deepseek-search-api/deepseek-fetch-api 注册进 ctx.web；每次操作跟随会话的 DeepSeek 凭据（最近模型请求走 deepseek-account 路由则用其 token 发往该路由 origin，否则用 API-key 路由的 key 或 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY 发官方 base；路由设置不解析则失败而非换端点）；能力自有 *BaseURL/*ApiKeyEnv 时独占该端点与 key；ready 在下次操作将无凭据时报不可用。",
   "tags": [
    "plugin-entry",
    "provider-registration",
    "credential-routing",
    "cordis-plugin"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex",
   "languageNotes": "设置经 volatile 逐操作快照读取（一次操作绝不混用两节设置）；旧字段（baseURL/apiKeyEnv/apiKey）加载不报错但无效果——迁移友好。"
  },
