  {
   "id": "file:packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/search.ts",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "search.ts",
   "filePath": "packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/search.ts",
   "summary": "DeepSeek Search API provider：每次搜索一次直接请求（need_content false）；滑窗 QPS 限流（默认账户级 5 req/s，waitForRequestSlot 含首毫秒的 1 秒窗）；ori_question 截断到 128 字符；mapSearchResponse 严格校验 results 数组并保留 title/snippet/summary/date 投影。",
   "tags": [
    "web-search-provider",
    "rate-limiting",
    "response-validation"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex"
  },
  {
   "id": "function:packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/search.ts:mapSearchResponse",
   "type": "function",
   "name": "mapSearchResponse",
   "filePath": "packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/search.ts",
   "lineRange": [
    50,
    66
   ],
   "summary": "校验非受信 Search 响应并投影为 WebSearchResult：逐条核对 url/title/snippet/summary/date 类型，非法即 WebError；空串字段省略。",
   "tags": [
    "validation",
    "projection",
    "untrusted-json"
   ],
   "complexity": "moderate"
  },
  {
   "id": "class:packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/search.ts:DeepSeekSearchApiProvider",
   "type": "class",
   "name": "DeepSeekSearchApiProvider",
   "filePath": "packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/search.ts",
   "lineRange": [
    72,
    139
   ],
   "summary": "implements WebSearchProvider（id deepseek-search-api）：search 以 min(count, maxResults) 请求、可选 ori_question，经 dispatchDeepSeekWeb POST /search；waitForRequestSlot 以单调开始时间滑窗强制 requestsPerSecond，等待中取消抛 WEB_ABORTED。",
   "tags": [
    "web-search-provider",
    "qps-window",
    "provider-role"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex"
  },
  {
   "id": "file:packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/transport.ts",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "transport.ts",
   "filePath": "packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/transport.ts",
   "summary": "Search/Fetch 共享的认证与拒重定向传输：account token 优先（仅发往其 origin，401 时精确失效该 token 且指引重新登录而非改端点）、否则 API key/credential resolver；fetch 配置 redirect:'error'（包组 AGENTS.md 规约）；错误统一映射——中途取消永远是 WEB_ABORTED（读错误体时也不例外）、HTTP 失败带 endpoint guidance 指引用户配置。",
   "tags": [
    "transport",
    "authentication",
    "redirect-rejection",
    "error-mapping"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex",
   "languageNotes": "401+account 的失效可能取消 Session：先读完 HTTP 失败再失效；失效失败不覆盖原错误。"
  },
  {
   "id": "function:packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/transport.ts:hasDeepSeekWebCredential",
   "type": "function",
   "name": "hasDeepSeekWebCredential",
   "filePath": "packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/transport.ts",
   "lineRange": [
    91,
    93
   ],
   "summary": "检查认证源是否存在（literal key/resolver/account），不解析凭据值。",
   "tags": [
    "predicate",
    "credentials",
    "boolean-check"
   ],
   "complexity": "simple"
  },
  {
   "id": "function:packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/transport.ts:dispatchDeepSeekWeb",
   "type": "function",
   "name": "dispatchDeepSeekWeb",
   "filePath": "packages/web/web-deepseek-api/src/transport.ts",
   "lineRange": [
    128,
    209
   ],
   "summary": "一次操作的全流程：解析认证头→waitToSend 限流→recordRequest（模型输入留痕）→redirect:error 的 POST→非 2xx 读错误体（account 401 走精确失效+登录指引）→decode 校验投影；取消信号在每个阶段胜出。",
   "tags": [
    "dispatch",
    "cancellation-contract",
    "error-mapping"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex"
  },
